W Linux live/install medium.

The installer normally starts automatically on this console. If you're seeing
this prompt, it exited or was interrupted — run it again with:
  bash /root/w/scripts/install.sh

For Wi-Fi, use nmcli (NetworkManager) — e.g. `nmcli device wifi connect <SSID> password <PASS>`.
Ethernet should come up automatically via DHCP.
